 `kit-light` class; an inline script\n  in `<head>`/`<body>` reads the stored preference (or falls back to\n  `prefers-color-scheme`) and applies `kit-light` before the rest of the\n  page renders, avoiding a flash of the wrong theme.\n- Added a theme toggle button (sun/moon emoji, `kit-button--ghost`) in\n  the nav, wired up in `src/js/app.js` via `KnechtKit.toggleTheme()`,\n  persisting the chosen mode to `localStorage`.\n- Removed the hardcoded `text-black!` nav link classes; the kit already\n  colors anchors via `--kit-accent-strong`, which adapts correctly to\n  both themes, so the class was simply dropped rather than overridden.\n\nCloses CC-16.\n\n---\n**Preview:** http://76.preview.lvh.me:3333","created_at":"2026-09-21T13:08:48Z","updated_at":"2026-09-22T10:41:43Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"0126eb99a325fcabc63f10638df7c73ab8debc29","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/knecht-works/test-craftcms/pulls/28/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/knecht-works/test-craftcms/pulls/28/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/knecht-works/test-craftcms/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/knecht-works/test-craftcms/issues/28/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/knecht-works/test-craftcms/statuses/6c53b049bb9f6cc00b7780c0c14158e6b3cbbecc","head":{"label":"knecht-works:cc-16-dark-mode","ref":"cc-16-dark-mode","sha":"6c53b049bb9f6cc00b7780c0c14158e6b3cbbecc","user":{"login":"knecht-works","id":289418356,"node_id":"O_kgDOEUAsdA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/289418356?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/knecht-works","html_url":"https://github.com/knecht-works","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/knecht-works/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/knecht-works/following{/